OL,4,CDiesel tanker capsizes near Ibiza    W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAn oil tanker carrying up to 7,000   W5
OL,7,Gtonnes of diesel has capsized off    W5
OL,8,Gthe coast of Ibiza, leaving one crew W5
OL,9,Gmember dead, authorities have said.  W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GThe Med Emre, a Malta-flagged        W5
OL,12,Gvessel, was carrying 17 crew members W5
OL,13,Gwho were all rescued. However seven  W5
OL,14,Gwere taken to hospital and one was   W5
OL,15,Glater pronounced dead, Balearic      W5
OL,16,GIslands emergency services confirmed.W5
OL,17,                                      W5
OL,18,GThe six crew receiving treatment     W5
OL,19,Greportedly suffered minor injuries,  W5
OL,20,Gsuch as hypothermia, Spanish media   W5
OL,21,Greports.                             W5
OL,22,                                      W5
